    "long_instructions": "#Mood Board Design\r\n\r\nChat with the AI about how to design a mood board that captures your chosen brand’s vibe.\r\n\r\nAsk about colors, fonts, imagery, and style words that match your brand’s personality. Share your ideas, upload images, and get feedback or refinements from the AI.",
